{"id": 540, "modified": "2026-10-08T15:31:23", "slug": "medical-pathology", "content": {"raw": "<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-lead\">Medical pathology examines tissue and cell samples to establish a diagnosis and guide treatment, with an emphasis on fast and accurate reporting. The department at our partner hospital includes immunohistochemistry and cytopathology laboratories and works with the microbiology and genetics laboratories for advanced methods. MedLuxLife coordinates the practical steps, including the transfer of existing samples and the translation of reports.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":929,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-450.jpg\" alt=\"Medical Pathology - specialist hospital care\" class=\"wp-image-929\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Treatments and services</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Intraoperative frozen section</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Rapid assessment of suspicious tissue during surgery, available at any time of day, to support decisions in the operating theatre.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Biopsy reporting</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Biopsy samples are reported within a few working days, depending on their nature.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Rapid processing for urgent cases</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Accelerated processing when cancer is suspected or urgent treatment is needed, so a preliminary diagnosis can be reached without delay.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Histochemistry and immunohistochemistry</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Staining panels, manual or automated, that help determine tumour origin, classification, proliferation index and prognostic markers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Immunohistochemistry laboratory</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Diagnostic histochemical and immunohistochemical staining and immunofluorescence studies, with daily automated processing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Advanced molecular methods</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>PCR, flow cytometry and in situ hybridisation carried out jointly with the microbiology and genetics laboratories.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cytopathology</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Liquid-based and conventional cytology, with immunocytochemistry when needed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">On-site sample adequacy assessment</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Pathologists check sample adequacy on site while interventional teams take diagnostic samples.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Before you travel</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To get a reliable medical opinion quickly, please prepare:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Recent medical reports and discharge summaries</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Imaging (MRI, CT, X-ray) on CD or as DICOM files, with the radiology reports</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Recent laboratory results</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>A list of your current medications and any allergies</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Original pathology reports</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Paraffin blocks and slides for review, if a second opinion is requested</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-steps\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Share your wishes and, if available, recent X-rays or photos. We answer your questions and explain the options.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-cta\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your Medical Pathology consultation with confidence</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every treatment begins with a personal, no-obligation consultation. Contact us and we will get back to you as soon as possible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://medluxlife.de/contact/\">Request a Free Consultation</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-whatsapp\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-disclaimer\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->"}}